{"seq":2,"slug":"python-basics","title":"高一信息技术 — Python基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/information-technology/programming-fundamentals/python-basics","wordCount":1520,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一信息技术-python基础\">高一信息技术 — Python基础</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>上节课我们学习了算法和流程图，掌握了用图形化方式描述解决问题的步骤。现在，是时候将这些算法思想转化为计算机能够执行的代码了。Python是当今世界上最流行的编程语言之一，以语法简洁、易于上手著称——它的设计哲学就是&quot;优美胜于丑陋，简洁胜于复杂&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>Python语言的核心要素：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变量</td>\n<td>存储数据的&quot;容器&quot;，可以随时改变内容</td>\n<td><code>name = &quot;张三&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据类型</td>\n<td>数据的种类，决定了数据的存储方式和运算规则</td>\n<td>整数int、浮点数float、字符串str、布尔值bool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运算符</td>\n<td>对数据进行操作的符号</td>\n<td><code>+</code>、<code>-</code>、<code>*</code>、<code>/</code>、<code>//</code>、<code>%</code>、<code>**</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入输出</td>\n<td>与用户交互的基本方式</td>\n<td><code>input()</code>获取输入、<code>print()</code>输出结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制结构</td>\n<td>控制程序执行流程</td>\n<td><code>if-elif-else</code>选择、<code>for</code>/<code>while</code>循环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>为什么选择Python作为入门语言？</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>语法接近自然语言，降低学习门槛</li>\n<li>不需要声明变量类型（动态类型语言）</li>\n<li>用缩进表示代码块，代码结构清晰</li>\n<li>拥有丰富的标准库和第三方库</li>\n<li>广泛应用于数据科学、人工智能、Web开发等领域</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-python基本语法\">一、Python基本语法</h3><p><strong>变量与赋值：</strong></p>\n<p>在Python中，创建变量不需要提前声明类型，直接用等号赋值即可：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"age = 16&#10;height = 1.72&#10;name = &quot;李华&quot;&#10;is_student = True\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.72</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"李华\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">is_student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span></code></pre></div><p>变量命名规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只能包含字母、数字和下划线，且不能以数字开头</li>\n<li>区分大小写（<code>Age</code>和<code>age</code>是不同的变量）</li>\n<li>不能使用Python关键字（如<code>if</code>、<code>for</code>、<code>while</code>等）</li>\n<li>建议使用有意义的名称（如<code>student_name</code>而非<code>a</code>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>数据类型：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>英文名</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>没有小数部分的数</td>\n<td><code>42</code>、<code>-7</code>、<code>0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮点数</td>\n<td>float</td>\n<td>带小数部分的数</td>\n<td><code>3.14</code>、<code>-0.5</code>、<code>1.0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td>str</td>\n<td>用引号括起来的文本</td>\n<td><code>&quot;Hello&quot;</code>、<code>&#39;Python&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔值</td>\n<td>bool</td>\n<td>逻辑值，只有两个取值</td>\n<td><code>True</code>、<code>False</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表</td>\n<td>list</td>\n<td>有序的可变集合</td>\n<td><code>[1, 2, 3]</code>、<code>[&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;]</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>类型转换：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"num_str = &quot;123&quot;&#10;num_int = int(num_str)&#10;num_float = float(num_str)&#10;back_to_str = str(num_int)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_str </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"123\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_int </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_str)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_float </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_str)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">back_to_str </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_int)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"二-输入与输出\">二、输入与输出</h3><p><strong>输出——print()函数：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"print(&quot;你好，世界！&quot;)&#10;print(&quot;我今年&quot;, 16, &quot;岁&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;圆周率约等于{3.14159:.2f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你好，世界！\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"我今年\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"岁\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"圆周率约等于</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{3.14159</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>f-string</code>（格式化字符串）是Python 3.6引入的特性，用花括号<code>{}</code>嵌入变量或表达式，非常实用。</p>\n<p><strong>输入——input()函数：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"name = input(&quot;请输入你的名字：&quot;)&#10;age = int(input(&quot;请输入你的年龄：&quot;))&#10;print(f&quot;{name}，你好！你明年{age + 1}岁。&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请输入你的名字：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请输入你的年龄：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">，你好！你明年</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">岁。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>input()</code>返回的始终是字符串类型，如果需要数值运算必须用<code>int()</code>或<code>float()</code>转换。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-运算符\">三、运算符</h3><p><strong>算术运算符：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运算符</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>+</code></td>\n<td>加法</td>\n<td><code>7 + 3</code></td>\n<td><code>10</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-</code></td>\n<td>减法</td>\n<td><code>7 - 3</code></td>\n<td><code>4</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>*</code></td>\n<td>乘法</td>\n<td><code>7 * 3</code></td>\n<td><code>21</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/</code></td>\n<td>除法（结果为浮点数）</td>\n<td><code>7 / 3</code></td>\n<td><code>2.333...</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>//</code></td>\n<td>整除（取商的整数部分）</td>\n<td><code>7 // 3</code></td>\n<td><code>2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>%</code></td>\n<td>取余（取余数）</td>\n<td><code>7 % 3</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>**</code></td>\n<td>幂运算</td>\n<td><code>2 ** 10</code></td>\n<td><code>1024</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>比较运算符：</strong></p>\n<p><code>==</code>（等于）、<code>!=</code>（不等于）、<code>&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;</code>、<code>&gt;=</code>、<code>&lt;=</code></p>\n<p>比较运算的结果是布尔值<code>True</code>或<code>False</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>逻辑运算符：</strong></p>\n<p><code>and</code>（与）、<code>or</code>（或）、<code>not</code>（非）</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"age = 16&#10;is_student = True&#10;print(age &gt;= 18 and is_student)&#10;print(age &gt;= 18 or is_student)&#10;print(not is_student)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">is_student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 18</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_student)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 18</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_student)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_student)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"四-选择结构\">四、选择结构</h3><p>Python用<code>if-elif-else</code>实现分支选择，注意<strong>缩进是Python的语法要求</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"score = int(input(&quot;请输入成绩：&quot;))&#10;if score &gt;= 90:&#10;    print(&quot;优秀&quot;)&#10;elif score &gt;= 80:&#10;    print(&quot;良好&quot;)&#10;elif score &gt;= 60:&#10;    print(&quot;及格&quot;)&#10;else:&#10;    print(&quot;不及格&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请输入成绩：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#